        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Limitations of the Study</title>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body{\n    margin:0;\n    background:#f0f0f0;\n    font-family:\"Segoe UI\", Calibri, Arial, sans-serif;\n  }\n  .slide{\n    width:540px;\n    height:305px;\n    background:#ffffff;\n    position:relative;\n    margin:0 auto;\n    box-sizing:border-box;\n    overflow:hidden;\n  }\n  .topbar{\n    background:#1F3864;\n    color:#ffffff;\n    height:29px;\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:center;\n    font-size:11.5px;\n  }\n  .topbar .tab{\n    flex:1;\n    text-align:center;\n  }\n  .topbar .active{\n    font-weight:bold;\n    position:relative;\n  }\n  .arrow{\n    position:absolute;\n    left:33.3%;\n    top:29px;\n    width:0;\n    height:0;\n    border-left:9px solid transparent;\n    border-right:9px solid transparent;\n    border-top:9px solid #1F3864;\n    transform:translateX(56px);\n  }\n  h1.title{\n    font-size:21px;\n    font-weight:normal;\n    color:#000;\n    margin:8px 0 6px 22px;\n  }\n  .lvl1{\n    color:#C00000;\n    font-weight:bold;\n    font-size:13px;\n    margin:0 0 0 44px;\n    line-height:1.75;\n    text-indent:-18px;\n    padding-left:18px;\n    max-width:445px;\n  }\n  .bullet2{\n    color:#000;\n    font-size:11px;\n    margin:6px 0 0 84px;\n    line-height:1.85;\n    text-indent:-16px;\n    padding-left:16px;\n    max-width:400px;\n  }\n  .blue{\n    color:#1F5FA9;\n    font-weight:bold;\n    font-size:13px;\n    margin:10px 0 0 40px;\n    line-height:1.7;\n    text-indent:-16px;\n    padding-left:16px;\n    max-width:450px;\n  }\n  ol.abc{\n    color:#000;\n    font-size:11.5px;\n    margin:6px 0 0 60px;\n    padding-left:22px;\n    line-height:2;\n  }\n  .check{\n    color:#000;\n    font-size:10.5px;\n    margin:6px 0 0 84px;\n    line-height:1.9;\n    text-indent:-16px;\n    padding-left:16px;\n    max-width:400px;\n  }\n  .footer{\n    position:absolute;\n    bottom:8px;\n    left:0;\n    width:100%;\n    display:flex;\n    justify-content:flex-start;\n    font-size:11px;\n    color:#bfbfbf;\n  }\n  .footer .step{\n    width:85px;\n    text-align:center;\n    border-top:2px solid #d9d9d9;\n    padding-top:4px;\n    margin-left:22px;\n  }\n  .footer .step.on{\n    color:#1F3864;\n    border-top:2px solid #1F3864;\n  }\n  .pagenum{\n    position:absolute;\n    right:12px;\n    bottom:14px;\n    font-size:8px;\n    color:#bfbfbf;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"slide\">\n  <div class=\"topbar\">\n    <div class=\"tab\">Novelty &amp; Significance</div>\n    <div class=\"tab active\">Limitations of the Study</div>\n    <div class=\"tab\">Future Work</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"arrow\"></div>\n\n  <h1 class=\"title\">Limitations</h1>\n\n  <p class=\"lvl1\">b.&nbsp;&nbsp;Approximately 25% of enrolled patients were unable to proceed to vaccination:</p>\n\n  <p class=\"bullet2\">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The majority due to either disease progression or inability to generate vaccines because of <b>low tumor content in the biopsy samples or a low number of mutations.</b></p>\n\n  <p class=\"blue\">&rarr;&nbsp;Opportunities to mitigate this issue include:</p>\n\n  <ol class=\"abc\" type=\"a\">\n    <li>Acceleration of vaccine production timelines</li>\n    <li>Incorporation of potentially higher-yield tumor sampling approaches</li>\n    <li>Selection of alternative clinical settings can be envisioned</li>\n  </ol>\n\n  <div class=\"footer\">\n    <div class=\"step\">Background</div>\n    <div class=\"step\" style=\"margin-left:0\">Study Design</div>\n    <div class=\"step\" style=\"margin-left:0\">Result</div>\n    <div class=\"step on\" style=\"margin-left:0\">Conclusion</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pagenum\">39</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"slide\">\n  <div class=\"topbar\">\n    <div class=\"tab\">Novelty &amp; Significance</div>\n    <div class=\"tab active\">Limitations of the Study</div>\n    <div class=\"tab\">Future Work</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"arrow\"></div>\n\n  <h1 class=\"title\">Limitations</h1>\n\n  <p class=\"lvl1\">c.&nbsp;&nbsp;It is unclear whether pre-vaccine nivolumab contributed to vaccine-induced T cell responses:</p>\n\n  <p class=\"bullet2\">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Major pathologic responses were noted post-vaccination melanoma patients who did not initially respond to nivolumab.</p>\n\n  <p class=\"blue\">&rarr;&nbsp;Refining the sequence of different agents in combination immunotherapy for best clinical outcomes needs further study.</p>\n\n  <p class=\"check\">&#10003;&nbsp;&nbsp;Alternative immunoncologic agents, such as anti-CTLA-4, that can preferentially expand naive CD8+ T cells to increase the T cell pool for vaccine priming, might be better a choice for pre-vaccine immunotherapy.</p>\n\n  <div class=\"footer\">\n    <div class=\"step\">Background</div>\n    <div class=\"step\" style=\"margin-left:0\">Study Design</div>\n    <div class=\"step\" style=\"margin-left:0\">Result</div>\n    <div class=\"step on\" style=\"margin-left:0\">Conclusion</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pagenum\">40</div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
